{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33801","headline":"太湖诗 销夏湾 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 销夏湾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太湖有曲处，其门爲两崖。\n当中数十顷，别如一天池。\n号爲销夏湾，此名无所私。\n赤日莫斜照，清风多遥吹。\n沙屿埽粉墨，松竹调埙篪。\n山果红靺鞨，水苔青髬髵。\n木阴厚若瓦，严磴滑如饴。\n我来此游息，夏景方赫曦。\n一坐盘石上，肃肃寒生肌。\n小艖或可泛，短策或可支。\n行惊翠羽起，坐见白莲披。\n敛袖弄轻浪，解巾敌凉颸。\n但有水云见，更余沙禽知。\n京洛往来客，暍死缘奔驰。\n此中便可老，焉用名利爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}